# Romsets and MAME's own working files. The project never ships or commits a
# romset; these entries are the second line of defence after the packager's
# check. Loose-file sets have no telltale extension, so ignore the directories.
/spnchout/
/armwrest/
/cfg/
/nvram/
/mamecfg/
